<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-asia</id><updated>2026-09-06T12:13:08Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-asia" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/s-12758?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-asia" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>India news: Rahul Gandhi backs student protests in Maharashtra</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e7489d8cdfa5c57e8979692300d120324c0bd3c07169255978ec85e96f603a22</id><updated>2026-09-06T12:12:59Z</updated><published>2026-09-06T10:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-rahul-gandhi-backs-student-protests-in-maharashtra/live-79043198--c16d7d5783ef.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-rahul-gandhi-backs-student-protests-in-maharashtra/live-79043198?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Opposition Rahul Gandhi has said that students are "tormented" by the ruling Bharatiya Janata Party. The Congress politician has demanded immediate action into the demands of Maharashtra student protesters. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>How climate change and food insecurity could fuel future conflicts</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8f04eab3c6bb950309b7f4a82526b088a5f2e1c33e4d5bc70bbb717a6922f373</id><updated>2026-09-06T12:13:08Z</updated><published>2026-09-06T07:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-climate-change-and-food-insecurity-could-fuel-future-conflicts/a-78871431--8e63f64c4115.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-climate-change-and-food-insecurity-could-fuel-future-conflicts/a-78871431?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Climate change, conflict, and trade tensions are putting pressure on the global food system. New research suggests the biggest risk is not food shortages, but whether societies can peacefully adapt to change.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Indonesia: Flights canceled as Anak Krakatau volcano erupts</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:80e5af285ee8e44ab9d107776fa7fc7d3c2fce193b1c8f0fd3af6e903553db4b</id><updated>2026-09-06T12:12:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-06T07:33:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/indonesia-flights-canceled-as-anak-krakatau-volcano-erupts/a-79050871--17392aeed85d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/indonesia-flights-canceled-as-anak-krakatau-volcano-erupts/a-79050871?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The spread of ash after the volcanic eruption of Anak Krakatau has impacted thousands of passengers, as flights were canceled at Jakarta's international airport.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nepal flood disaster puts climate justice under spotlight</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c320e5bd198413ec1282e6e84288abc20a9195945dd8f724b7ddc04e81b8199a</id><updated>2026-09-06T12:12:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T13:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nepal-flood-disaster-puts-climate-justice-under-spotlight/a-78998617--8f177ec379f1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nepal-flood-disaster-puts-climate-justice-under-spotlight/a-78998617?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The devastating Himalayan glacial floods have raised broader questions about who should bear the costs and responsibility for the impacts of climate-related disasters.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Why North Korea's women's football team is so good</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dc0f5c1c58a28e413128286b71ab37c204e56e610e8b1990b6462c80efae3fba</id><updated>2026-09-06T12:12:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T10:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-north-korea-s-women-s-football-team-is-so-good/a-70313505--6b31ccb5ebf0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-north-korea-s-women-s-football-team-is-so-good/a-70313505?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">North Korea's young footballers enter the U-20 World Cup in Poland as defending champions — the 2024 title was their third. Why is the isolated state so good at the game?</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>US sanctions halt TOEFL and GRE tests in Iran, disrupting study plans</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f682212c5d572f56c794488afb00b0084cf541c9719ad206715eb2230bc13c0f</id><updated>2026-09-06T12:12:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T14:24:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-sanctions-halt-toefl-and-gre-tests-in-iran-disrupting-study-plans/a-78764639--4e7bec2b9a4e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-sanctions-halt-toefl-and-gre-tests-in-iran-disrupting-study-plans/a-78764639?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Students in Iran can no longer take English-language proficiency exams after the suspension of a US sanctions exemption. Applicants say the move threatens university deadlines and adds costly travel obligations.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Can communities be proteced from melting glaciers?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e5b4eb5d11de0c9ea69658784220eee1dcbd4526cfe9c2f4321b1723baee411f</id><updated>2026-09-06T12:12:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T13:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/as-glaciers-melt-can-communities-be-protected/a-78615775--a898d3259825.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/can-communities-be-proteced-from-melting-glaciers/a-78615775?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Rising temperatures are increasing the risk of floods and avalanches in mountain regions. The disaster in Nepal and Tibet shows the urgent need for solutions, and the tools that could help save lives.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Will Bangladesh join the Mecca defense alliance?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1e49f12e46a915dece598cacf3f2aec59d928ae8643046f2f7a7e8c78a82dcc0</id><updated>2026-09-06T12:12:34Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T12:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/will-bangladesh-join-the-mecca-defense-alliance/a-78613944--650fbd31b54b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/will-bangladesh-join-the-mecca-defense-alliance/a-78613944?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">While Bangladesh weighs the risks of signing the Mecca Joint Defense Agreement, experts warn that such a move could complicate relations with neighboring India.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>How China buried Tibet flood images after Nepal disaster</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:782140b2ef719d6a7f3b8a3661ea7a320d177ac1fdc821884dc68ba85a42ad85</id><updated>2026-09-06T12:12:34Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T14:19:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-china-buried-tibet-flood-images-after-nepal-disaster/a-78576472--7e7c26844487.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-china-buried-tibet-flood-images-after-nepal-disaster/a-78576472?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">In Tibet, a digital crackdown followed the deadly flood that has devastated communities along the China-Nepal border. Censors erased viral footage while Chinese state media flooded platforms with official content.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
